# npm lockfile — this project uses bun (bun.lock) as its package manager.
# package-lock.json can appear locally if npm is used for one-off tooling
# (e.g. Chapter 2's verification test, which needed tsx/prisma outside bun);
# not committed, to avoid two competing lockfiles.
package-lock.json
